() Tj T*
(A heap is a complete tree satisfying the heap property. It powers priority) Tj T*
(queues: insert and extract-min are O\(log n\), peek is O\(1\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Graphs are vertices and edges. BFS explores level by level \(shortest path) Tj T*
(in unweighted graphs\); DFS explores deep first \(cycle detection, topo sort\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Dynamic programming caches subproblem results when a problem has optimal) Tj T*
(substructure and overlapping subproblems - turning exponential into) Tj T*
(polynomial time.) Tj T*
